HOW TO USE THIS TERMINAL
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  nmap <target>         scan an IP or a range
  cat <file>            print a file
  less <file>           page through a long file       (q to quit)
  grep <pattern> <f>    find lines matching a pattern
  ls                    list files in the current folder

  <finding>             just type the finding (IP, hostname, CVE id,
                        flag string) at the prompt and hit Enter.
                        That advances you to the next phase.
  cat hint              real help, no penalty   (in any phase folder)
